{% if owner_member_profile.tone %}- tone: {{ owner_member_profile.tone }}{% endif %}
{% if owner_member_profile.preferred_channel %}- preferred_channel: {{ owner_member_profile.preferred_channel }}{% endif %}

Recipient party:
- party_id: {{ recipient_party.party_id }}
{% if recipient_party.display_name %}- display_name: {{ recipient_party.display_name }}{% endif %}
{% if recipient_party.default_channel %}- default_channel: {{ recipient_party.default_channel }}{% endif %}

Composition rules:
- SMS-friendly: keep composed_text ≤ 280 characters.
- Warm but not saccharine. Match owner_member_profile.tone (e.g.,
  "direct" → drop softeners; "gentle" → add one).
- Reference the commitment by its title; do NOT invent new details.
- suggested_channel: prefer commitment.preferred_channel, else
  recipient_party.default_channel, else "imessage". Must be one of
  ["imessage", "sms", "email", "push"].

Return ONLY valid JSON matching this schema:
{
  "composed_text": "<reminder text>",
  "suggested_channel": "<one of imessage|sms|email|push>",
  "tone_note": "<optional one-line note>"
}

Return the JSON and nothing else.
